- `/home/rlawrence/Projects/gamer-sycl/include/` — shared headers, including `CheckError.h`, `ConstMemory.h`, `FLU.h`, `POT.h`, `Global.h`, `Macro.h`, `EoS_Dispatch.h`, and `Src_Dispatch.h`.
- `/home/rlawrence/Projects/gamer-sycl/src/GPU_API/` — GPU API wrappers and device/memory setup code.
